## 3. Use Case Diagram

```mermaid
usecaseDiagram
    actor "Patient / Caregiver" as User
    actor "AI Engine" as AI
    
    package "MedTrack AI System" {
        usecase "Scan Prescription" as UC1
        usecase "Log Medication Intake" as UC2
        usecase "Manage Inventory" as UC3
        usecase "View Health Scores" as UC4
        usecase "Configure Profiles" as UC5
    }
    
    User --> UC1
    User --> UC2
    User --> UC3
    User --> UC4
    User --> UC5
    
    UC1 ..> AI : <<include>>
    UC4 ..> AI : <<include>>
```

